Package: cmbridge
Type: Package
Title: Conditional-Moment Learners for Bridge and Adjoint Equations
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("OpenAI", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com"))
Description: Standardized estimators for functions identified by conditional
    moment restrictions of the form E[Y - D h(X) | Z] = 0. Implements sieve
    minimum distance, Landweber iterative regularization, and a scalable kernel
    maximum-moment-restriction learner, with convenience wrappers for the
    inverse-probability bridge and adjoint equations used in proximal and
    shadow-variable estimation. Cross-validated convex ensembles combine
    candidate learners using a common kernel conditional-moment loss.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, splines, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), np, npiv, gmm
Config/testthat/edition: 3
